{
  "id": "zh-a1-questions",
  "category": "Mandarin A1",
  "language": "zh",
  "title": "Asking Questions: 吗, 呢, 吧, V不V, 还是, question words, tags",
  "description": "Yes/no with 吗, 'and you?' with 呢, suggestions with 吧, A-not-A questions, either-or with 还是, and where question words go.",
  "level": "A1",
  "points": [
    {
      "id": "ma",
      "title": "…吗? yes/no questions",
      "summary": "Add 吗 (ma) to a statement to make a yes/no question. Don't add 吗 to questions that already are questions (V不V, question words, 还是).",
      "body": "- 你喝咖啡**吗**?\n- ~~你喝不喝咖啡吗?~~ ✗\n- ~~你去哪儿吗?~~ ✗",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{你|nǐ}{喝|hē}{咖啡|kāfēi}{吗|ma}？",
          "Do you drink coffee?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ne",
      "title": "…呢? and you? / where is …?",
      "summary": "Noun + 呢 = 'and (what about) …?' after a statement, or 'where is …?' on its own.",
      "body": "- 我很好，你**呢**? (I'm fine, and you?)\n- 我的手机**呢**? (Where's my phone?)",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{我|wǒ}{很|hěn}{好|hǎo}，{你|nǐ}{呢|ne}？",
          "I'm fine, and you?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ba",
      "title": "Command / suggestion + 吧",
      "summary": "吧 (ba) softens a suggestion: 'let's …', '… why don't you'.",
      "body": "- 我们一起去**吧**! (Let's go together!)\n- 你休息一下**吧** (Why don't you take a rest).",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{我们|wǒmen}{一起|yìqǐ}{去|qù}{吧|ba}！",
          "Let's go together!"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vnotv",
      "title": "Verb 不 verb? (A-not-A)",
      "summary": "Repeat the verb/adjective with 不 in between: 去不去? 忙不忙? For 有: 有没有. No 吗 and no 很.",
      "body": "- 你**去不去**? (Are you going?)\n- 你**忙不忙**? — not ~~很忙不忙~~.\n- 你**有没有**时间?",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{你|nǐ}{有|yǒu}{没有|méiyǒu}{时间|shíjiān}？",
          "Do you have time?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "qword",
      "title": "Question words stay in place",
      "summary": "什么, 谁, 哪儿, 什么时候, 为什么, 怎么 go where the answer would be — the word order doesn't change.",
      "body": "- 你去**哪儿**? → 我去北京.\n- **谁**是你的老师? → 王老师是我的老师.\n- No 吗 at the end.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{你|nǐ}{去|qù}{哪儿|nǎr}？",
          "Where are you going?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "zenme",
      "title": "怎么 + verb: how to …",
      "summary": "怎么 (zěnme) + verb asks for the way to do something.",
      "body": "- 这个字**怎么**读? (How do you read this character?)\n- 你**怎么**来学校? — 坐地铁 (by subway).",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{这个|zhège}{字|zì}{怎么|zěnme}{读|dú}？",
          "How do you read this character?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "haishi",
      "title": "A 还是 B? (either-or question)",
      "summary": "还是 (háishi) offers a choice in a question. No 吗.",
      "body": "- 你喝茶**还是**喝咖啡?\n- ~~…还是…吗?~~ ✗\n- 或者 also means 'or', but in statements, not in either-or questions.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{你|nǐ}{喝|hē}{茶|chá}{还是|háishi}{喝|hē}{咖啡|kāfēi}？",
          "Will you have tea or coffee?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tag",
      "title": "Tag questions: 是不是 / 好吗 / 对吗",
      "summary": "Statement + ，是不是? / 对不对? / 好吗? = '…, right? / …, OK?'",
      "body": "- 你是美国人，**是不是**?\n- 我们明天去，**好吗**?",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{我们|wǒmen}{明天|míngtiān}{去|qù}，{好|hǎo}{吗|ma}？",
          "Let's go tomorrow, OK?"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
